Z||000000||penetrator||07-17-2001||07:41 PM||||Hi<BR>I have a minor leak from the right axel seal in the gearbox. And i have ordered som new seals for a 86 4-speed and i got some blue seals, and what i can se the seals on the car is red? Is it the same seal for all transmissions all year, or áre they color coded as i suspect?<P>||||reg||1
